    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "口径与缺失状态",
      "type": "text",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "wallet-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "暂无有效数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "仅使用指定采集目标；余额和消费均为共享数据库 Gauge。\n\n**历史不足或任一端点不可用时不计算预测；无数据不等于零。** 余额 ≤ 0 表示余额已耗尽。净消费 ≤ 0 时无有效速度；退款可使净消费下降。\n\n七天预测包含钱包与订阅净消费，不是精确归零日期。当前测试数据只积累了几分钟，七天预测预期为空。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "user_id",
        "label": "用户",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "wallet-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(new_api_user_info{job=\"new-api\",deployment=\"issue15-validation\",instance=\"host.docker.internal:33416\"}, user_id)",
        "definition": "label_values(new_api_user_info{job=\"new-api\",deployment=\"issue15-validation\",instance=\"host.docker.internal:33416\"}, user_id)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}